	(text "LFO speed: 0.5Hz to 2.5Hz\nDelay times: up to 25ms\n\nClock frequencies for 25ms:\nTdelay=Nstages/(2*Fclk)\nFclk=Nstages/(2*Tdelay)\n512/(2*.025)=10kHz\n\nThus, anti-aliasing/reconstruction filters with cutoff of <5kHz (Nyquist limit)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 115.57 161.29 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
